.mb-6
  .flex.flex-wrap.items-center.justify-between.gap-3
    h1 class=kb_page_title メモイラスト
    = link_to "新しいイラスト", new_memo_illustration_path, class: kb_btn_primary_sm
  p.mt-1.text-sm.kb-text-secondary メモや文章から、キーワードを抽出してイラストを生成します。

- if @memo_illustrations.any?
  section.nyoy-card-list
    - @memo_illustrations.each do |illustration|
      article.kb-card.p-4.nyoy-card-item
        .flex.flex-wrap.items-center.justify-between.gap-2.mb-2
          span class="nyoy-status nyoy-status-#{illustration.status}" = illustration.status_label
          .flex.flex-wrap.items-center.gap-2
            - if illustration.sd_model.present?
              span.text-xs.kb-text-muted = illustration.sd_model
            = render "shared/card_open_link", path: memo_illustration_path(illustration)
            - unless illustration.in_progress?
              = render "shared/card_delete_button", path: memo_illustration_path(illustration), confirm: "このイラストを削除しますか？"
        p.text-sm.kb-text-secondary = truncate(illustration.body, length: 80)
        - if illustration.image.attached?
          = render "shared/card_image_link", path: memo_illustration_path(illustration), source: illustration.image.variant(resize_to_limit: [256, 256]), alt: illustration.body
- else
  p.text-sm.kb-text-muted まだ生成履歴がありません。
